- F2a — proof-f2a.log. Add <span>GSE</span> to the rendered ContactPage. The
  rendered sweep fails: "contact: GSE -> GSE Contact Us Get in touch ...".
  The sweep joins text nodes with spaces so an isolated element stays a word.
- F2b — proof-f2b.log. Add "95% coming in 2026" to the Math en hero description.
  The generated-route-metadata check fails on the stale date, and the restored
  scoped check fails with "math: 95%".
- F3a — proof-f3a.log. Remove textColor="dark" from the rendered Products page.
  The hero subtitle check fails: expected 'rgb(51, 65, 85)' to be
  'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9)'.
- F3b — proof-f3b.log. Add blur-sm to the workbook image in b2b-solutions.tsx.
  The real-CSS check fails: "workbook image must carry no blur utility:
  expected [ 'blur-sm' ] to deeply equal []".
- F4a — proof-f4a.log. Change the phone anchor href to tel:+660000000000 while
  keeping its label. The destination check fails: expected
  'tel:+660990058038' to be 'tel:+660000000000'.
- F4b — proof-f4b.log. Hard-code the English "Close" label in the Sheet close
